  "details": "Currently, the \"Avatar Self-Interact\" setting affects both PhysBones and Contacts. However, sometimes we want to disable only one of them.\n\nFor example, we might want to disable PhysBone self-interaction when there is no need to grab a PhysBone, but still keep Contacts self-interaction enabled for gimmicks.\n\nTherefore, we suggest separating the self-interaction settings for PhysBones and Contacts.",
